<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n37876" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">prae-rādo</span></b> , no <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>perf.</i>, sum, 3, v.
				a.
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>To scrape</i> or <i>shave off in
			front</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">latus alterum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cato, R. R. 41</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Paul. Nol. Ep. 7</span></i>, sect. 2.
			—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>To shear</i> or <i>shave off
			before</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">praerasi capilli,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cael.
						Aur. Tard. 5, 4, 74</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">id. Acut. 1, 11, 79</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
